ind":"update","title":"This Is Not a Snake Game: Content Update | Additional Language Support","summary":"Hello, everyone!Thank you for playing the previously released demo of This Is Not a Snake Game!With Steam Next Fest here, our little snake has returned from the depths of the internet with a “game update package” 🐍! What an incredible adventure!Now, let’s open it up and see what new goodies are inside：Added support for English and Traditional Chinese;Added a Polaroid feature that lets you decorate photos of your little snake;Added a survey button, allowing you to open the questionnaire directly ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T02:52:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688628","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4489630-1840944183787697","game_id":"steam-4489630","kind":"announcement","title":"桌宠挂机游戏《别让贪吃蛇思考》来袭！8月18日开启免费试玩！","summary":"还记得千禧年最经典的游戏形象“贪吃蛇”么？“贪吃蛇”曾陪伴无数玩家度过童年时光，而这一次，我们发现——小蛇似乎开始“思考”了？！在《别让贪吃蛇思考》中，你要利用系统bug将它从原来的世界拯救出来，将这个记忆中的伙伴养在桌面，陪伴你工作、学习、摸鱼、发呆！游戏中可以通过敲击键盘、点击鼠标等方式获取积分并解锁新地图，派出贪吃蛇探索各地，带回各类主题外观装扮自己！《别让贪吃蛇思考》免费试玩版本（Demo）将于8月18日正式登陆Steam，如果你对这条开始思考的小蛇感兴趣，欢迎将游戏添加至愿望单并关注。游玩过程若有任何意见或者建议，或者遇到了游戏BUG，请您填写贪吃蛇反馈问卷【点击此处】，我们十分重视您的意见，这将对我们在完善游戏内容、优化游戏体验方面，带来巨大的帮助！如果你想第一时间获取开发动态、试玩情报，或者和更多玩家一起交流讨论，欢迎关注我们的官方社交媒体，也欢迎加入我们的官方 QQ 群：🐍 官方玩家交流群：1092514787 🐍期待和大家正式见面 ✧⁺⸜( •̀ω•́ )⸝⁺✧","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-18T02:48:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183787697","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4489630":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:17Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:16Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attem